{"id":"1e47661fa15be194","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-cof-complexity.md","title":"Cof 的 Sigma3 完全性","display":"thm-cof-complexity — Cof 的 Sigma3 完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-cof-complexity","aliases":["20-thm-cof-complexity"],"display":"thm-cof-complexity — Cof 的 Sigma3 完全性","chapter":"4","section":"4.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.3","source_pdf_pages":[123,124],"source_printed_pages":[87,88],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cof]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","[[20-thm-inf-complexity]]","[[20-df-movable-markers]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-cof-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-cof-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cof-complexity — Cof 的 Sigma3 完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>123</span><span>124</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>87</span><span>88</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cof}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cof}\\)</span> 采用标准 c.e. 编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cof\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\ne\\in\\mathrm{Cof}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\ \\forall x\\ge N\\ \\exists s\\ [x\\in W_{e,s}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Cof},\\Sigma^0_3).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cof\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\ne\\in\\mathrm{Cof}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\ \\forall x\\ge N\\ \\exists s\\ [x\\in W_{e,s}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Cof},\\Sigma^0_3).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显示式给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_3\">\\(\\Sigma_3\\)</span> 上界。给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\Sigma_3\">\\(P\\in\\Sigma_3\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\\iff\\exists y\\ R(x,y)\">\\(x\\in P\\iff\\exists y\\ R(x,y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Pi_2\">\\(R\\in\\Pi_2\\)</span>；由 Inf 证明的统一矩阵编译取得全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(x,y)\\iff W_{g(x,y)}\">\\(R(x,y)\\iff W_{g(x,y)}\\)</span> 无限。</p>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0=\\varnothing\">\\(B_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>，用本阶段开始时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus B_s\">\\(\\omega\\setminus B_s\\)</span> 的递增标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y(s)\">\\(b_y(s)\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le s\">\\(y\\le s\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{g(x,y)}\">\\(W_{g(x,y)}\\)</span> 在本阶段收到新成员，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y(s)\">\\(b_y(s)\\)</span> 枚举入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{s+1}\">\\(B_{s+1}\\)</span>，其他元素不变。这是统一 c.e. 构造，且每次受踢标记严格上移。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\">\\(x\\in P\\)</span>，某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 被踢无穷次，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y(s)\\to\\infty\">\\(b_y(s)\\to\\infty\\)</span>。补集若有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y+1\">\\(y+1\\)</span> 个最终成员，它们会给该标记一个固定上界，矛盾；所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 余有限。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin P\">\\(x\\notin P\\)</span>，所有踢集有限。归纳固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>：低于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 的标记稳定后，不再有低位删除；本标记自己的踢集也最终不再变化，所有高位删除不影响它，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y(s)\">\\(b_y(s)\\)</span> 稳定。各稳定值严格递增，补集无限。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\\iff B_x\">\\(x\\in P\\iff B_x\\)</span> 余有限。s-m-n 与 padding 给普通单射指标函数，证明完全性。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.3.3；印刷 87–88 / PDF 123–124，原构造与验证位于第二页。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cof","status":"resolved","id":"ddc81bc510c82f3e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cof]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-inf-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"14c630355ef04ac5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-inf-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-movable-markers","